Port of _patches/typescript/022-ls-completions.patch (tsc/internal/ls/completions.go) to tsrs.

- AfterCompletionCallback, RegisterAfterCompletionCallback: `tsrs_ls::{AfterCompletionCallback,
  register_after_completion_callback}` (a `fn` in a process-wide `RwLock`; registering replaces the previous one).
- ProvideCompletion converts the list, passes its items (a copy: Go shares the slice) through the callback, and
  replaces the items with a non-empty result (creating the list if there was none), before ensureItemData.

